## What it shows:
End-to-end attacker journey.

## Structure:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
A[Attacker (Kali Linux)] --> B[Recon (IP Discovery + Port 3389)]
B --> C[Brute Force Attempts<br>(Event ID 4625)]
C --> D[Successful Login<br>(Event ID 4624)]
D --> E[Unauthorized RDP Access]
